#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:128
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Google "
"Analytics`, then paste the measurement ID in the :guilabel:`Measurement ID "
"or Tag` field and click :guilabel:`Save`."
